WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Recycling and lifecycle. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Compare boundaries in material claims

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Lifecycle claims depend on system boundaries, energy sources, lifetime and end-of-life assumptions. Compare like with like.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: A recycling comparison needs the same mass basis and included process stages on both sides.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Lifecycle boundary sort

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Material category alone does not guarantee strength, durability or safety.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Compare boundaries in material claims
